" end="0:31.643">me)</span></span></p><p begin="0:31.653" end="0:34.993" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:31.653" end="0:32.043">Let</span> <span begin="0:32.043" end="0:32.163">'em</span> <span begin="0:32.163" end="0:32.353">see</span> <span begin="0:32.353" end="0:32.523">you</span> <span begin="0:32.523" end="0:32.993">smi</span><span begin="0:32.993" end="0:33.443">ling</span> <span begin="0:33.443" end="0:33.623">on</span> <span begin="0:33.623" end="0:33.723">the</span> <span begin="0:33.723" end="0:34.153">front</span> <span begin="0:34.153" end="0:34.573">pa</span><span begin="0:34.573" end="0:34.993">ges</span></p><p begin="0:34.996" end="0:37.576" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:34.996" end="0:35.416">Mama,</span> <span begin="0:35.416" end="0:35.636">I</span> <span begin="0:35.636" end="0:36.236">made</span> <span begin="0:36.236" end="0:36.546">it,</span> <span begin="0:36.546" end="0:36.796">look</span> <span begin="0:36.796" end="0:36.926">at,</span> <span begin="0:36.926" end="0:37.186">look</span> <span begin="0:37.186" end="0:37.306">at</span> <span begin="0:37.306" end="0:37.576">me</span><span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="0:37.774" end="0:38.174">(All</span> <span begin="0:38.174" end="0:38.574">eyes</span> <span begin="0:38.574" end="0:38.714">on</span> <span begin="0:38.714" end="0:39.302">me)</span></span></p><p begin="0:38.789" end="0:41.279" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:38.789" end="0:39.309">Smi</span><span begin="0:39.309" end="0:39.699">ling</span> <span begin="0:39.699" end="0:39.969">'cause</span> <span begin="0:39.969" end="0:40.099">it's</span> <span begin="0:40.099" end="0:40.479">con</span><span begin="0:40.479" end="0:40.889">ta</span><span begin="0:40.889" end="0:41.279">gious</span></p><p begin="0:41.274" end="0:43.904" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:41.274" end="0:41.534">Do</span> <span begin="0:41.534" end="0:41.654">it</span> <span begin="0:41.654" end="0:41.894">f